('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.background.section-1','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Before wearing background','background','[data-media-background-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.background.section-1"]','background-image','','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.background.section-2','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Fit and adjustment background','background','[data-media-background-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.background.section-2"]','background-image','','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.h1','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Main heading: Coin and spoon ring care','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.h1"]','textContent','Coin and spoon ring care','',1,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.h1.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after Coin and spoon ring care','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.h1.body"]','textContent','Repurposed-metal rings can carry texture, pattern, age, and character that mass-produced jewelry does not. Their care should match the actual metal, finish, sizing, and condition of the piece.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.2','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Heading: Before wearing','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.2"]','textContent','Before wearing','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.2.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after Before wearing','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.2.body"]','textContent','Check the listing for material and size. Do not assume every patterned ring is sterling silver: some pieces are stainless steel, plated, mixed-metal, or of unknown composition. If you have a metal sensitivity, ask before purchase.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.3','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Heading: Fit and adjustment','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.3"]','textContent','Fit and adjustment','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.3.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after Fit and adjustment','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.3.body"]','textContent','Rings should not be forced over a knuckle or squeezed repeatedly. Repeated bending can stress some designs, patterns, solder points, or older metal. Contact us before using a ring stretcher, reducer, or pliers on a handmade or repurposed ring.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.4','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Heading: Cleaning and storage','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.4"]','textContent','Cleaning and storage','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.4.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after Cleaning and storage','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.4.body"]','textContent','Use a soft dry cloth first. Store rings separately from abrasive tools and loose hardware. If a piece has a special patina, darkened detail, stone, resin, or plated finish, ask before using a polish or chemical cleaner.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.5','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Heading: Gift note','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.5"]','textContent','Gift note','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.5.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after Gift note','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.5.body"]','textContent','A ring size, material note, and care card make a gift easier to enjoy. For custom or themed ring work, confirm sizing and timing before payment or engraving begins.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
