('/workshop-journal/coin-and-spoon-ring-care','workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.6.body','Coin & Spoon Ring Care / Text after When in doubt, ask first','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-coin-and-spoon-ring-care.text.heading.6.body"]','textContent','If a listing has a special finish, a vintage condition detail, a custom sizing question, or product-specific safety notes, the individual listing and direct message take priority over this general guide.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
