('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.h1','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Main heading: Polymer clay earring care','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.h1"]','textContent','Polymer clay earring care','',1,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.h1.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after Polymer clay earring care','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.h1.body"]','textContent','Polymer clay earrings are lightweight and practical for everyday wear, but like other handmade jewelry they benefit from gentle handling and sensible storage.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.2','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Heading: Wear and storage','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.2"]','textContent','Wear and storage','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.2.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after Wear and storage','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.2.body"]','textContent','Put earrings on after hair spray, perfume, lotions, and makeup have had time to settle. Store pairs where they are not pressed under heavy metal pieces, sharp edges, or loose tools that can scratch the surface.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.3','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Heading: Cleaning','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.3"]','textContent','Cleaning','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.3.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after Cleaning','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.3.body"]','textContent','Start with a soft dry cloth. If the listing permits it, a barely damp soft cloth may be used for a small surface mark, then dry the piece right away. Do not soak handmade earrings or use harsh household cleaners unless the product-specific care note says it is safe.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.4','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Heading: Handmade variation','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.4"]','textContent','Handmade variation','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.4.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after Handmade variation','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.4.body"]','textContent','Small differences in pattern, marbling, texture, placement, or finish are normal in handmade work. We describe obvious variation and use close-up photos where possible so the piece a buyer receives is clear.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.5','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Heading: When to contact us','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.5"]','textContent','When to contact us','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.5.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after When to contact us','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.5.body"]','textContent','Contact us before trying a repair, glue, solvent, polish, or strong cleaner. A metal finding, resin accent, paint, or sealant can change the right care method for one specific piece.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.6','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Heading: When in doubt, ask first','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.6"]','textContent','When in doubt, ask first','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/polymer-clay-earring-care','workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.6.body','Polymer Clay Earring Care / Text after When in doubt, ask first','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-polymer-clay-earring-care.text.heading.6.body"]','textContent','If a listing has a special finish, a vintage condition detail, a custom sizing question, or product-specific safety notes, the individual listing and direct message take priority over this general guide.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.hero.image','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Hero image','image','[data-media-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.hero.image"]','src','/assets/placeholders/media-content/workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide-hero-image.svg','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide visual',1,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.section.visual.1','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Handmade visual','image','[data-media-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.section.visual.1"]','src','/assets/placeholders/media-content/workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide-section-visual-1.svg','Placeholder for Handmade',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.hero','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Hero background','background','[data-media-background-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.hero"]','background-image','','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.section-1','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Handmade background','background','[data-media-background-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.section-1"]','background-image','','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.section-2','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Vintage, antique, collectible, and sourced background','background','[data-media-background-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.background.section-2"]','background-image','','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.h1','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Main heading: Handmade, vintage, and sourced: what the labels mean','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.h1"]','textContent','Handmade, vintage, and sourced: what the labels mean','',1,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.h1.body','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Text after Handmade, vintage, and sourced: what the labels mean','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.h1.body"]','textContent','Clear labels help buyers understand what they are looking at before they decide whether a piece is right for them.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.2','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Heading: Handmade','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.2"]','textContent','Handmade','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.2.body','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Text after Handmade','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.2.body"]','textContent','Handmade means the item was made, assembled, carved, cast, engraved, printed, painted, polished, or otherwise worked on in the Devil n Dove workshop. Each listing should state actual materials, process notes, and any meaningful handmade variation.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.3','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Heading: Vintage, antique, collectible, and sourced','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.3"]','textContent','Vintage, antique, collectible, and sourced','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.3.body','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Text after Vintage, antique, collectible, and sourced','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.3.body"]','textContent','These labels describe found or pre-existing items. We do not represent them as newly handmade. Listings should make room for condition, wear, repairs, known or estimated era, provenance clues, cleaning notes, and unknowns.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.4','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Heading: One of a kind and small batch','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.4"]','textContent','One of a kind and small batch','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.4.body','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Text after One of a kind and small batch','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.4.body"]','textContent','One of a kind means that exact item is not expected to be duplicated. Small batch means related pieces may exist, but colour, pattern, placement, or finish can vary. The product page should say which situation applies.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.5','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Heading: Questions before purchase','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.5"]','textContent','Questions before purchase','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.5.body','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Text after Questions before purchase','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.5.body"]','textContent','Ask about condition, material, size, pickup, shipping, or a close-up before buying. Clear questions are part of a good handmade and vintage shopping experience.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/workshop-journal/handmade-vintage-sourced-guide','workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.6','Handmade / Vintage / Sourced Guide / Heading: When in doubt, ask first','text','[data-content-slot="workshop-journal-handmade-vintage-sourced-guide.text.heading.6"]','textContent','When in doubt, ask first','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
