('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.h1','Marketplace Guide / Main heading: Understand Devil n Dove sale channels and marketplace links','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.h1"]','textContent','Understand Devil n Dove sale channels and marketplace links','',1,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.h1.body','Marketplace Guide / Text after Understand Devil n Dove sale channels and marketplace l','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.h1.body"]','textContent','Some Devil n Dove items are sold directly here, some are hybrid-listed, and some are easier to sell on Facebook Marketplace or another venue. This page explains how we keep those differences visible.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.2','Marketplace Guide / Heading: How to read our listings','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.2"]','textContent','How to read our listings','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.3','Marketplace Guide / Heading: Marketplace channels','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.3"]','textContent','Marketplace channels','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.3.body','Marketplace Guide / Text after Marketplace channels','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.3.body"]','textContent','Facebook Marketplace, local vending, and other outside channels can be useful for larger items, pickup-friendly pieces, old tools, curiosities, and one-off finds that are easier to explain in a direct listing or local conversation.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.4','Marketplace Guide / Heading: Pickup, support, and local questions','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.4"]','textContent','Pickup, support, and local questions','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.4.body','Marketplace Guide / Text after Pickup, support, and local questions','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.4.body"]','textContent','We are based in Southern Ontario, Canada. That means some buyers are local enough to ask about pickup, viewing, or timing before they commit to a purchase. We would rather have those questions asked early than leave uncertainty about channel, travel, or packaging.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.5','Marketplace Guide / Heading: Handmade work','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.5"]','textContent','Handmade work','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.5.body','Marketplace Guide / Text after Handmade work','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.5.body"]','textContent','Handmade items should point shoppers back to process, materials, and the wider workshop story.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.6','Marketplace Guide / Heading: Vintage & collectible stock','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.6"]','textContent','Vintage & collectible stock','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.6.body','Marketplace Guide / Text after Vintage & collectible stock','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.6.body"]','textContent','Found items should show provenance clues, era notes, and condition summaries before a buyer follows any outside link.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('/marketplaces','marketplaces.text.heading.7','Marketplace Guide / Heading: About the sourcing side','text','[data-content-slot="marketplaces.text.heading.7"]','textContent','About the sourcing side','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
