('/pickup','pickup.text.h1.body','Local Pickup / Text after Understand local pickup, availability, and support befo','text','[data-content-slot="pickup.text.h1.body"]','textContent','Some items are easier to ship, some are better handled through local pickup, and some external or hybrid listings need one more conversation before a buyer commits.','',0,1,NULL,NULL,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
